      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">agent-session-resume</h1><a id=\"user-content-agent-session-resume\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: agent-session-resume\" href=\"#agent-session-resume\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>agent-session-resume</code> is a reusable skill for continuing work from a prior AI coding-agent session without losing context, duplicating completed work, or overwriting unrelated changes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It is designed for handoffs between tools such as Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity, and OpenCode.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Instead of asking the next agent to guess what happened, the skill makes it produce a handoff checkpoint first: the prior goal, what is already done, what is still open, and the next action to take before editing.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">What It Does</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-it-does\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What It Does\" href=\"#what-it-does\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The skill gives an agent a disciplined resume workflow:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>locate the most relevant prior transcript, export, artifact, or session summary</li>\n<li>read the full available context before taking action</li>\n<li>reconstruct the original goal, completed work, decisions, and stopping point</li>\n<li>extract explicit and implicit tasks</li>\n<li>classify each task as <code>DONE</code>, <code>PARTIALLY DONE</code>, or <code>NOT DONE</code></li>\n<li>continue from the first unfinished step without repeating completed work</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Repository Layout</h2><a id=\"user-content-repository-layout\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Repository Layout\" href=\"#repository-layout\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\".claude-plugin/\n  marketplace.json\n  plugin.json\nskills/\n  agent-session-resume/\n    SKILL.md\n    agents/\n      openai.yaml\n    references/\n      antigravity.md\n      claude-code.md\n      codex.md\n      cursor.md\n      opencode.md\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>.claude-plugin/\n  marketplace.json\n  plugin.json\nskills/\n  agent-session-resume/\n    SKILL.md\n    agents/\n      openai.yaml\n    references/\n      antigravity.md\n      claude-code.md\n      codex.md\n      cursor.md\n      opencode.md\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Install</h2><a id=\"user-content-install\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Install\" href=\"#install\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The quickest way to install is the <a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills\"><code>skills</code></a> CLI (<code>npx skills</code>). It reads the canonical <code>skills/agent-session-resume</code> folder from this repo and installs it for whichever agent you target — no manual cloning or copying.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Install (interactive — choose which agents to install into):</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx skills add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume\"><pre>npx skills add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Install for specific agents without prompts:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx skills add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume -a claude-code -a codex -a cursor -a opencode -y\"><pre>npx skills add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume -a claude-code -a codex -a cursor -a opencode -y</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Install globally (user-level instead of the current project) with <code>-g</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx skills add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume -g\"><pre>npx skills add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume -g</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update to the latest version:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx skills update agent-session-resume\"><pre>npx skills update agent-session-resume</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>npx skills update</code> with no name updates every installed skill. List or remove the skill with <code>npx skills list</code> and <code>npx skills remove agent-session-resume</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After installing or updating, restart the agent (or start a new session) so it loads the current instructions.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Claude Code plugin (alternative)</h3><a id=\"user-content-claude-code-plugin-alternative\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Claude Code plugin (alternative)\" href=\"#claude-code-plugin-alternative\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you prefer a Claude Code plugin with a namespaced command instead of the <code>npx skills</code> flow, add the marketplace and install the plugin:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/plugin marketplace add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume\n/plugin install agent-session-resume@hacktivist123\n/reload-plugins\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>/plugin marketplace add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume\n/plugin install agent-session-resume@hacktivist123\n/reload-plugins\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CLI equivalent:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"claude plugin marketplace add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume\nclaude plugin install agent-session-resume@hacktivist123\"><pre>claude plugin marketplace add hacktivist123/agent-session-resume\nclaude plugin install agent-session-resume@hacktivist123</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This gives the namespaced command <code>/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume</code>. The marketplace id is <code>hacktivist123</code> (defined in <code>.claude-plugin/marketplace.json</code>), so the install reference is <code>agent-session-resume@hacktivist123</code>. Restart Claude Code or run <code>/reload-plugins</code> after installing.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Other Agents</h3><a id=\"user-content-other-agents\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Other Agents\" href=\"#other-agents\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>npx skills</code> supports 70+ agents; pass <code>-a &lt;agent&gt;</code> to target one (for example <code>-a github-copilot</code>, <code>-a windsurf</code>, or <code>-a cline</code>). For an agent the CLI does not cover, load <code>skills/agent-session-resume/SKILL.md</code> as the main instruction document and use the relevant platform file from <code>skills/agent-session-resume/references/</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Usage</h2><a id=\"user-content-usage\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Usage\" href=\"#usage\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Short prompts should be enough; the skill carries the platform-specific discovery rules.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For more examples, see the <a href=\"/hacktivist123/agent-session-resume/blob/main/docs/Cookbook.md\">cookbook</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For benchmark areas, fixture expectations, and issue/PR evaluation fields, see <a href=\"/hacktivist123/agent-session-resume/blob/main/docs/Benchmarking.md\">Benchmarking</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Continue the most recent Codex session for the current repository:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume\n\nContinue the most recent Codex session for this repository.\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume\n\nContinue the most recent Codex session for this repository.\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Continue from a specific handoff file:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume\n\nContinue from ./handoff.md.\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume\n\nContinue from ./handoff.md.\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Expected first response shape:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"Brief context summary\nLoaded skill: path=&lt;loaded SKILL.md path or unknown&gt;; source/version=&lt;marker or unknown&gt;\nTask status breakdown\nUser deferrals\nClear next action\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>Brief context summary\nLoaded skill: path=&lt;loaded SKILL.md path or unknown&gt;; source/version=&lt;marker or unknown&gt;\nTask status breakdown\nUser deferrals\nClear next action\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After that checkpoint, the agent should continue from the first unfinished step without redoing completed work.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Skill Source And Deferrals</h2><a id=\"user-content-skill-source-and-deferrals\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Skill Source And Deferrals\" href=\"#skill-source-and-deferrals\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Resume reports should identify the loaded skill path and source/version marker when available, and should say <code>unknown</code> when the runtime does not expose them. Useful markers include the Claude plugin manifest version, marketplace package version, git commit, tag, package source, or a checksum of the loaded <code>SKILL.md</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">When comparing Codex and Claude Code behavior, compare the known install paths before concluding that the same skill version ran:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/agent-session-resume/SKILL.md\n$HOME/.claude/skills/agent-session-resume/SKILL.md\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/agent-session-resume/SKILL.md\n$HOME/.claude/skills/agent-session-resume/SKILL.md\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Explicit user deferrals such as \"skip\", \"park\", \"leave out\", or \"not now\" should be preserved in resume context. A vague prompt such as \"Proceed\" should not unpark that scope without confirmation.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Claude Code Notes</h2><a id=\"user-content-claude-code-notes\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Claude Code Notes\" href=\"#claude-code-notes\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Recommended plugin install gives the namespaced command:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>/agent-session-resume:agent-session-resume\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Alternative standalone install gives the shorter skill command:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/agent-session-resume\"><pre lang=\"text\" class=\"notranslate\"><code>/agent-session-resume\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If the plugin command does not appear after installation, run <code>/reload-plugins</code> and check the marketplace/plugin manifests with:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"claude plugin validate .\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/plugin.json\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/marketplace.json\"><pre>claude plugin validate <span class=\"pl-c1\">.</span>\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/plugin.json\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/marketplace.json</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Checks</h2><a id=\"user-content-checks\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Checks\" href=\"#checks\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Run the package and fixture validators:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"python3 scripts/validate-skill-package.py\npython3 scripts/validate-fixtures.py\npython3 scripts/validate-trigger-matrix.py\nclaude plugin validate .\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/plugin.json\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/marketplace.json\"><pre>python3 scripts/validate-skill-package.py\npython3 scripts/validate-fixtures.py\npython3 scripts/validate-trigger-matrix.py\nclaude plugin validate <span class=\"pl-c1\">.</span>\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/plugin.json\nclaude plugin validate .claude-plugin/marketplace.json</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The standalone skill under <code>skills/agent-session-resume</code> is the source of truth. The optional Claude plugin wrapper uses the repo root as its source, so it shares that canonical skill folder instead of maintaining a second copy. The fixtures in <code>tests/fixtures/</code> cover Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity, and OpenCode handoff shapes. Each scenario pairs sample session material with the expected context summary, task status breakdown, and next action. <code>tests/trigger-matrix.json</code> tracks prompt coverage for manual or automated trigger testing.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Use <a href=\"/hacktivist123/agent-session-resume/blob/main/docs/Benchmarking.md\">docs/Benchmarking.md</a> when proposing improvements so PRs explain what behavior changed, how it was measured, and what a good result looks like.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"